flowchart TB
 ISP["ISP / Internet / approved external providers"]:::ext --> ROUTER["Physical OpenWrt router<br/>firewall4 + nftables; dnsmasq + odhcpd"]:::source
 ROUTER --> PUBLIC["Explicit public ingress only<br/>Caddy 443 / signed webhooks / approved sites"]:::process
 ROUTER --> MGMT["Private management network<br/>local console + SSH + selected VPN plane"]:::control
 MGMT --> PVE["Proxmox VE host<br/>supported host networking; not generic guest networkd"]:::process
 PVE --> G1["Debian role: core ops<br/>Caddy, Keycloak, secrets clients, monitoring"]:::process
 PVE --> G2["Debian role: data<br/>PostgreSQL, MariaDB, validated Valkey<br/>SeaweedFS roles"]:::process
 PVE --> G3["Debian role: business apps<br/>OpenProject, WordPress, Mautic<br/>ResourceSpace, Postiz + Temporal, Matomo"]:::process
 PVE --> G4["Debian role: AI and bounded jobs<br/>llama.cpp, OmniRoute, ComfyUI, MLflow<br/>FFmpeg, Pandoc, Vale, Lighthouse, Mermaid"]:::process
 PVE --> G5["Dedicated voice boundary<br/>Asterisk / Pipecat / call controller<br/>SIP + RTP only as required"]:::process
 PVE --> G6["Isolated legacy guests<br/>preserve state; no automatic activation"]:::legacy
 PUBLIC --> G3
 G1 -. "scoped authentication / alerts" .-> G3
 G3 --> G2
 G3 --> G4
 G5 --> G4
 G5 --> SIP["External SIP trunk"]:::ext
 G3 --> MAIL["External managed SMTP / mailboxes"]:::ext
 G2 --> BACK["Independent encrypted off-host backup<br/>offline recovery keys"]:::done
 G6 --> BACK


